{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01234-s02","batch":1234,"shard":2,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":40,"shard_end_exclusive":60,"translated_count":5,"entries":[{"entry_index":40,"uid":"zhcn:bf25d04ae50d7f75832ed3aa","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……走吧。","source_fingerprint":"14a5831f7940f315e35b7e2b4afa3404611b474084a0e47e055fee99480dba33","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","31000"],"target_text":"…Đi thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":41,"uid":"zhcn:1cd8150fa2ae390585ef57b4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"呼……喝！！","source_fingerprint":"9abef90b47fe4139607b2768139e929102959ca7222abe06633e498b611172cb","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","40000"],"target_text":"Hừ… hây!!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":42,"uid":"zhcn:313da710176f064e51a6998d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"また親父からの連絡か…。\r\nベースは借りんと何回\r\n伝えたらわかるんだ…。","source_fingerprint":"ec0cf486013b02b353bfbe33bd1960cfaabef4bd9f0130d829116ce9eeb4e053","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","400001"],"target_text":"Lại bố liên lạc à…\r\nTôi đã bảo là không mượn bass rồi,\r\nphải nói bao nhiêu lần mới hiểu đây…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":43,"uid":"zhcn:ad495cc8e99537a1ea1194d0","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"啊啊，可恶……\r\n为什么每次回过神来，\r\n手上都有工作要做……！","source_fingerprint":"aa050847084426e70b3c27ae358e36a89798b1094d5ab2d68e61775139610894","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","400002"],"target_text":"A, chết tiệt…\r\nSao lần nào định thần lại,\r\ntrong tay cũng có việc phải làm thế này…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":44,"uid":"zhcn:c4855c34b97a33610fec06a1","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"猪肋排、烤牛肉……摊贩的食物\r\n感觉也很美味呢。气槽她……不在。\r\n该从哪一项开始吃呢……","source_fingerprint":"be4314177510842b3ec7751ba6c989bc109b308df008c2290658162adb4a1e14","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1016","400004"],"target_text":"Sườn heo, bò nướng… đồ ở các quầy\r\ntrông cũng ngon đấy. Air Groove… không có ở đây.\r\nBắt đầu từ món nào nhỉ…","reviewed":true}]}